<PageLayout title='Evolution Tools' kicker='PROJECT // TOOLBENCH' lead='Small tools for questions that should not require a giant platform.'>
<section><div class="prose content-page"><p>Evolution Tools is the software bench of Homogmos Lab: focused utilities, visualizers and reproducible mini-apps for evolutionary biology.</p><h2>$ design_rules</h2><ul><li>One clear scientific task per tool whenever possible</li><li>Transparent inputs and outputs</li><li>Reproducible examples</li><li>Useful without requiring proprietary infrastructure</li><li>Readable enough to teach from</li></ul><h2>$ candidate_tools</h2><ul><li>TMRCA landscape explorer</li><li>Simple phylogeny/tree viewer</li><li>Genome-window statistics visualizer</li><li>Sequence and FASTA utilities</li><li>Evolutionary simulation mini-apps</li></ul><p>Tools move from “candidate” to active project only when a working public version exists.</p></div></section>
</PageLayout>